Subject: [PATCH 396/443] [ae-patch] Voice mode on iPhone: do not hold the
 audio session with the priming utterance

On WebKit, primeVoicePlayback no longer speaks the silent utterance when the reply voice is the cloud voice, the cloud prime releases its audio element after the silent clip, and the mic start waits (100 ms polls, 1.5 s cap, then cancel) for a device-voice priming utterance to end. The Voice panel puts Run it, Decline, keyboard and End in one row.
